      "twitterUrl": "https://twitter.com/followlastma/status/1973262430277861546",
      "text": "[6:35AM] \n#LagBadagryExpWay\n#TrafficUpdate\nVehicular movement from Agbara Custom Check Point through Agbara Estate gate, Ajibade, Odofa, Church gate , Oko Afo,  Mowo enroute Aradagun down to Badagry roundabout is appreciable.\n\n  Movement from Badagry roundabout through Ibereko axis down to Ajibade is equally good.  \nAjibade through Morogbo junction down to Agbara Custom Check Point is slow, due to Market activities and pedestrian crossing around the corridor.\n#FollowLASTMA",
